Make DEV_COREDUMP configurable for external drivers. In-tree drivers can
select WANT_DEV_COREDUMP, but the kernel never reads an external driver's
Kconfig. Keep the existing default and ALLOW_DEV_COREDUMP dependency.

--- a/drivers/base/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/base/Kconfig
@@ -123,7 +123,7 @@ config ALLOW_DEV_COREDUMP
 	  If unsure, say Y.
 
 config DEV_COREDUMP
-	bool
+	bool "Device coredump support"
 	default y if WANT_DEV_COREDUMP
 	depends on ALLOW_DEV_COREDUMP
 
